{"about_the_game":"*Controller required*<br><br>The knight has wasted his life in many ways, most noticeably he wastes his days drinking, leading to forgetful actions and wasted opportunities. Take control of his life and feel the struggle of a knight so wasted he constantly forgets his own control scheme.<br><br>The world turns to him now that his King and fellow crusaders have been corrupted by evil miasma, the knight's life is hard enough so it didn't seem to affect him in any way! Best go knock some sense into his mates.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedurally generated control schemes</h2>An ever changing set of controls that changes depending on how drunk the knight is! The more he has drank the quicker he seems to forget his own actions.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023380/extras/1e344612e7e1af52abf6e3876934b9fe.poster.avif?t=1670789314\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023380/extras/1e344612e7e1af52abf6e3876934b9fe.webm?t=1670789314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023380/extras/1e344612e7e1af52abf6e3876934b9fe.mp4?t=1670789314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random layouts</h2>Enemy castles spawn procedurally making every room a new death trap.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023380/extras/a5213527b0c96f78dc2dc910456e1589.poster.avif?t=1670789314\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023380/extras/a5213527b0c96f78dc2dc910456e1589.webm?t=1670789314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_